cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "FedDisclosure Lab"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible laboratory for measuring federated learning disclosure.
  It trains real Flower models in Docker, applies Opacus DP, OpenDP and
  Flower SecAgg+, and attacks the results with membership inference and
  update inversion. A research benchmark, not a certified privacy product.
type: software
authors:
